# Step 5: contextual agent (test block, mean over 8 clients)

MELO alone = MELO over the pool with weekly refit, no drift. Proposed = MELO combiner + calibrated drift + follow-up refits. + agent = the contextual serving agent on top (soft, forget 0.999, temp 0.3; chosen on validation).

