## Significance (Diebold-Mariano, Newey-West lag 24 h, 8 clients x 5 scenarios = 40 series)

Per pair and loss: series where method 1 has lower loss / significantly lower (p < 0.05) / significantly higher; mean relative loss difference (negative = method 1 better); Wilcoxon signed-rank p over the 40 series.

